  "description": "It’s been a year since his divorce, and 32-year-old lawyer Seong Jae-Min has been living only for his work. One day, while exhausted from his job and the aftermath of his divorce, he receives a request to look after Seo-Ha, someone he briefly knew as a child, for a month. Seo-Ha, whom he hadn’t seen in 12 years, had grown into a full-fledged adult, a far cry from his childhood memories, and as he spends time with her, Jae-Min gradually regains his peace of mind. However, just as their month-long living arrangement seems to be going smoothly, an unexpected incident unfolds before them...\n\n(Source: Bomtoon, translated)",
